            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "If you're remodeling your only bathroom, you won't have access to it for 2-4 weeks. We recommend arranging alternative arrangements with neighbors, family, or a nearby gym. If you have multiple bathrooms, we can phase the work to ensure you always have at least one functional bathroom. Many Chicago homeowners with one bathroom choose to time their remodel around a vacation or stay elsewhere temporarily."
          }
