            "text": "We partner with two exceptional local interior designers who specialize in Chicago bathroom design. Both have extensive experience creating functional, beautiful bathrooms for every style and budget. Alternatively, you can work with your own designer, or we can help you select materials and create a layout without formal design services. We're flexible to match your needs and preferences."
