          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, we regularly relocate toilets, vanities, and showers to improve bathroom layouts. However, plumbing relocation adds both cost and time to your project. It requires opening walls and floors, rerouting supply and drain lines, and potentially updating venting. In condos, there may be building restrictions on plumbing relocation. We evaluate what's possible in your space and provide clear pricing for any plumbing changes."
          }
