            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We specialize in downtown Chicago condo remodels and are highly experienced with building requirements. We prepare and submit all necessary documentation to your building or HOA, coordinate with building management for water shutoffs, respect elevator and noise restrictions, ensure proper waterproofing meets building standards, and comply with all building-specific rules. We've worked in hundreds of Chicago buildings and understand the unique requirements of high-rise living."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What's your payment schedule for bathroom remodeling?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Our standard payment schedule is: (1) Deposit upon contract signing (typically 30-50%), (2) Payments at project milestones (demolition complete, rough-in complete, tile complete), (3) Final payment upon completion and your satisfaction. We never ask for full payment upfront, and we don't request final payment until you're completely satisfied with the work."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can you convert my tub to a walk-in shower?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, tub-to-shower conversions are one of our most popular bathroom remodeling services. This involves removing the existing tub, potentially raising the floor to accommodate new plumbing, installing a custom tile shower base, building and tiling shower walls, and adding glass enclosure or shower door. The result is a more spacious, modern, and accessible bathroom that better suits how most people actually use their bathrooms today."
          }
        }
